          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Nellie, Buzz and Gibbs are learning all about forces and magnets! They’ll head to the ski slopes to learn about friction, go back in time to witness the famous apple that helped Isaac Newton discover the law of gravity, before turning themselves into giant magnets to see what they attract and repel!\n\nBonus Chapter - An experiment you can try at home to test friction!",
